  "content": "\n\n<h1>釣竿修復</h1>\n<p>本模組修復以下狀況的釣線渲染錯誤：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>螢幕比例非 16:9</li>\n<li>玩家蹲下時</li>\n<li>鏡頭移動時</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>修復前：</h3>\n<p><img width=\"400\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/andrewchik0/fishing-rod-fix/assets/68250467/aaa8c3d7-a941-4643-b4bb-9513f837ea79\"></p>\n<h3>修復後：</h3>\n<p><img width=\"400\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/andrewchik0/fishing-rod-fix/assets/68250467/559f1e8b-92c6-49f1-8861-90396657bfdc\"></p>",
